  <item>
    <title>磨合期就是你愿意吃我剩下的包子皮，我愿意吃你不吃的包子馅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a94d0ebf03e74ee6b025163</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a94d0ebf03e74ee6b025163</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:01:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和别的留子一样，刚谈上恋爱秋秋就快过上了和男人“同居”的生活。周中见完周末见，公寓一个月有免费四次的guest parking，一周就轻轻松松用没。在快速发展的同居期间，有哪些事情是秋秋需要和另一个男人磨合的？</span></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span>本期Show Notes如下：</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a></span></u></a><span> 生活工作全面开花，i人难道永远会沦为e人的玩具</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></u></a><span> 如果两个人吃不到一起去，真的就过不下去吗？</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a></span></u></a><span> 如果吃的像个运动员，那么现在害我只需要一盘子松鼠桂鱼</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a></span></u></a><span> 当吃包子不吃皮只吃馅遇上了不吃馅料只吃皮</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a></span></u></a><span> 情侣一起睡觉都是一个光着睡，一个盖棉被睡吗</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a></span></u></a><span> 如果这个世界上秋秋不爱干净，那这个世界上就没有爱干净的人了</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a></span></u></a><span> 在关系里充当蒙古大夫疗愈师，健康的关系和健康的东西就都不好吃吗</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/manage?voicelistId=1000697667#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2801">46:41</a></span></u></a><span> 当淡定姐遇到了对手淡定哥，两个人在飞机起飞前半小时到达了登机口</span></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><strong><span>🔖所有《听我扯皮》节目会在:</span></strong></p><p><span>喜马拉雅 | 小宇宙 | 网易云音乐 | 苹果Podcast | Spotify 同步播出</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家关注我们的微博@听我扯皮22 和我们留言互动</span></p><p><strong><span>🔖听我扯皮的主播们还会出没在：</span></strong></p><p><span>小红书：rr碎碎念🐑 （秋秋）, 茗然 （铜铃r）</span></p>]]></description>
